Third-party components redistributed in the plugin distribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The distribution produced by `./gradlew installDist` bundles the runtime
dependencies below, because a Kafka Connect plugin directory has to be
self-contained: the worker loads it through an isolated plugin classloader and
does not resolve dependencies for it.

